<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日暴露年龄 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日暴露年龄 #每日怀旧 胳膊擦伤，刚用碘伏消毒，就突然想起小…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114802136893925970/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114802136893925970/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日暴露年龄&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%80%80%E6%97%A7" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日怀旧&lt;/span>&lt;/a>&lt;br>胳膊擦伤，刚用碘伏消毒，就突然想起小时候的“红药水儿”“紫药水儿”💉。一个红色一个紫色，红的俗称“二百二”。传说流血了抹红药水，感染了抹紫药水，就像游戏道具一样神奇 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/827bdcdc981cee1d99cf.png" alt=":0b04:" title=":0b04:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 。&lt;/p>&lt;p>今天查了一下，发现红药水主要成分是汞溴红，紫药水主要成分是龙胆紫。两者都有杀菌效果，但效果较差且含毒性，现在都已经被弃用了 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/190140f54f499ecd333c.png" alt=":aru_0010:" title=":aru_0010:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 。时代在进步，安全第一，还是用现代消毒剂靠谱！&lt;/p>
